{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["The reason for mentioning <b>when you come into the land</b>: because they observed all the festivals in the wilderness and Passover at Mount Sinai, for this pericope is adjacent to the erection of the Tabernacle." "The meaning of <b>speak to the children of Israel</b>: that they assemble, and afterward \"and you shall say to them.\""], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:11:51.427284858Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}